// chriz-iwd-encounters 330: when Gorg turns hostile, his wolf pack turns with him
// (MAP_GROUP_HOSTILE1, the pack's group variable) and comes to him (the area script
// answers CIE_JOR_GORG 1). On top of his script.

IF
  Allegiance(Myself,ENEMY)
  Global("CIE_JOR_GORG","MYAREA",0)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("CIE_JOR_GORG","MYAREA",1)
    SetGlobal("MAP_GROUP_HOSTILE1","MYAREA",1)
    Continue()
END
